  speakerName: Klara
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cf385c5c4168f354ca622b8557a81b73, type: 3}
  dialogueText: 'No agbilangka iti dua a banag, tattao, wenno aniaman a banag, agusar
    ti Ilokano iti ''dua.''


    Kayatna a saoen ti ''two.''


    Denggem a naimbag:
    dua.


    Ita, padasem nga ibagam ti ''dua'' iti bukodmo a timek.'
  translatedText: 'When you count two objects, people, or things, Ilokano uses ''dua.''

    It
    means ''two.''

    Now, try saying ''dua'' yourself.'
